{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 30, :comments ["<b>You shall betroth a woman</b> etc. Since it is the way of people to first build a house, and afterwards buy a field, and afterwards betroth a woman, as it is written in the perasha of Shofetim: 'Who is the man who built a house,' or 'who is the man who planted a vineyard,' and 'who is the man who betrothed a woman' — this fool went and reversed the order, so he is cursed according to his deeds."], :book :deuteronomy, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 28, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T14:54:33.849821028Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}